{"id":1130302,"chapter_id":1130302,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"红色的月亮占据了你的视线，仿佛是天空的眼睛，冰冷注视着大地。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"你站在一片花海之中，铺天盖地的紫色花瓣如潮水般向你涌来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"恐惧一步步逼近，你不禁狂奔起来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"但你无路可逃。天空的眼睛、紫色的潮信，注定要吞噬你。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"你张开嘴想要呼救，却说不出任何话，只能听到自己粗重的喘息声。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"四周的花田中，逐渐生长出诡异的藤蔓。紫色的花瓣在月光下泛着妖异的冷光……","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"你睁开眼睛，眼前却只有一片模糊的黑暗。头痛与晕眩感令你动弹不得。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"过了好一会儿，四周的视野逐渐清晰起来。你这才发现，手背上居然长出了一朵紫色的花。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"与此同时，堇正默默站在你的身前。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"花园、暗杀、FAC、业师、堇说过的话……巨量的信息在你的脑中疯狂流转，并最终达成了一个结论——","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"堇是来杀你的。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"options":["大声呼救","拔下手背上的花"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302014,"trial_step":14,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"大声呼救","goto":15},{"text":"拔下手背上的花","goto":16}]},{"step":15,"content":"你试图大声呼救引来守卫。但你太虚弱了，发出的声音根本不可能传出这个房间。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302015,"trial_step":15,"next":[17]},{"step":16,"content":"你试图拔下手背上那朵诡异的紫色小花。但手臂仿佛有千钧重量，根本无法行动。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"你意识到，你大概是中了某种神经毒剂。这样下去，死亡仅仅是时间问题。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"强烈的头痛让你根本无法集中精神，甚至连枷锁都无法发动。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"最后一线生机也被掐灭了。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"options":["你是来杀我的吗？"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302020,"trial_step":20,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你是来杀我的吗？","goto":21}]},{"step":21,"content":"你无比希望，堇能干脆地给你一个否定的答复。然而，她没有回答。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"半晌，堇才开口。她的笑容一如既往，却又透露出一股陌生的、无可奈何的苦涩。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"堇","content":"您还记得……那封信吗？","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"堇","content":"它是一道命令，出自业师之手。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"能神不知鬼不觉把书信塞进FAC的卷宗里……花园的手段，的确不容小觑。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"你的声音有些含混不清，语速很慢，但堇似乎还是在耐心地听着。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"可如果是暗杀命令，你来得未免有些晚了。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"如果你早就接到了命令，那这封信又有什么意义？增加你暴露的风险？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"堇","content":"暗杀您的任务，已经发布了很久。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"堇","content":"这封信，是对我的最后通牒。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"所以，你不是意外暴露而被管理局抓获。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"这一切都是花园的安排？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"堇","content":"……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"堇","content":"您一定……很失望吧。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"不，只是有些懊恼。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"我应该更谨慎一些。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"堇的眼中闪过了一丝明显的悲戚。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"堇","content":"不该这样的……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"堇","content":"我原本抱有幻想，觉得事情不必以这种形式收场。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"堇声音中的哀伤几乎溢了出来。这一刻，她就像个来到你办公室倾诉自己悲剧遭遇的普通女人。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"可她不普通，她来到管理局，逃脱重重看守，是为了杀你。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"为什么不干脆点动手。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"堇苦笑着摇了摇头。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"堇","content":"不，您没有明白我的意思……我……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"堇似乎陷入了犹豫与痛苦的纠缠之中。半晌，她才再度幽幽开口。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"堇","content":"……过去，我在制作花道作品时，都会赋予它们一个故事。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"堇","content":"我也给您讲个故事吧。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"强烈的头痛再一次袭来。眼前的一切变得模糊，只有堇的声音依稀可闻。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"堇","content":"从前，在辛迪加有一个叫奈菜的女孩……","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"堇","content":"有一天，奈菜的父母不见了。很快，附近的恶棍就缠上了她。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜无力抵抗，几乎死去。这时，有一位女士出现了。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"堇","content":"女士给了奈菜一把刀和两个选择——杀死恶棍，离开辛迪加，加入她的组织，成为她的学生；或者，就这么去死。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜只想活下去。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"堇停了下来，你有了些时间理解这个故事的含义。毫无疑问，这个故事中的“奈菜”正是堇自己。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"堇","content":"组织的训练……非常严苛。坚持下来的人不多，但他们会获得足以在这样的城市里活下去的力量。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"禁闭者……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"堇","content":"嗯……奈菜非常努力，她没有死在试炼当中，还获得了力量——即便是在这样的城市里，也足以自保的力量。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜很努力，也很幸运，没有死在试炼当中。业师……女士她，对奈菜的成长非常满意。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"堇","content":"她给了奈菜一个新的名字，向奈菜传授花道的技艺，让奈菜有了在新城立足的资本……她给了奈菜如今的一切。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"她只是在控制奈菜。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜知道，但奈菜不在乎。她只想报答业师。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜完成了业师给予的每一次任务。从不犹豫，也绝不失手。渐渐地，她几乎成了组织中最好的杀手。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"堇","content":"直到遇见最后一个暗杀对象……奈菜失败了。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"为什么会失败？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"堇","content":"……成为禁闭者的时间越久，就越容易感知到一些不存在的东西。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"堇","content":"它与能力带来的馈赠一起，纠缠在每一个人身上。就像是花园……在给你生的希望的同时，也给予了你名为痛苦的“礼物”。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"堇","content":"可奈菜最初接触到目标时，却发现那些困扰自己很久的幻觉消失了。也因此，奈菜错过了动手的时机。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"后来呢？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜观察了那个人很久。他不像寻常FAC的人那样顽固，也不像新城追捧奈菜的人那样盲目。","female_content":"奈菜观察了那个人很久。她不像寻常FAC的人那样顽固，也不像新城追捧奈菜的人那样盲目。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"堇","content":"他会思考自己做的事情是不是对的……和他一起的禁闭者，从来都不是只会执行命令……他们都很幸福。","female_content":"她会思考自己做的事情是不是对的……和她一起的禁闭者，从来都不是只会执行命令……他们都很幸福。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜从来没有遇见过这样的人。一开始只是好奇，后来便成了羡慕……回过神来，奈菜发现，自己无论如何也没法对他动手了。","female_content":"奈菜从来没有遇见过这样的人。一开始只是好奇，后来便成了羡慕……回过神来，奈菜发现，自己无论如何也没法对她动手了。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"他大概只是做自己该做的罢了。","female_content":"她大概只是，做自己该做的罢了。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"堇","content":"做自己该做的……从来都不容易。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"堇","content":"花道的最高技艺标准是……“如花在野”。插花瓶中的花，无论多么接近旷野里的样子，也只是无根浮萍。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"堇","content":"可这一次，奈菜觉得自己找到了可以真正依凭的大地。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"堇深吸了一口气。晕眩感在慢慢减退，她的声音变得愈发清晰。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜回去后，业师没有苛责她的失败，只是派出了新的杀手替她弥补过失。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"堇","content":"可奈菜非但没有感激业师的宽容，还屡次破坏了刺杀行动，甚至，打伤了曾和自己朝夕相处的朋友。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"堇","content":"之后，奈菜甚至主动暴露，去了那个人所在的地方。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"你是想说，奈菜在保护那个暗杀对象？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"堇","content":"……她只是不能眼睁睁地看着那个人死去。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜击退了几次袭击，可内心却越发不安……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"为什么？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"堇凄然一笑。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"堇","content":"因为……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"业师？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"堇","content":"……是的，业师。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"堇","content":"组织里的每一个人，所掌握的杀人方式，所学会的谋生技艺，都是业师传授的。没有人能战胜她。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"堇","content":"业师对她的“造物”有着近乎无穷的耐心。但她绝不容忍背叛。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜……恰恰背叛了她。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"content":"她的眼中浮现出绝望。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"堇","content":"奈菜还曾经心存侥幸，万一业师不屑于管这样的小事呢，万一业师还念着师生的情分呢？","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"堇","content":"可那封信，打碎了一切幻想。业师不可能放过他们。如果奈菜不动手，业师就会亲自处理一切。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"……我明白了。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"堇摇了摇头。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"窗外的的冷光斜斜地照在她身上，却仿佛只是照进了最黑暗的墙角——唯有那双眼睛，摇曳着微弱的光点","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"堇","content":"您不会明白的。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"堇望向窗外的天空。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"堇","content":"我必须离开了。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"离开？！","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"按照堇的说法，她背叛了业师。那封信意味着，业师给了她最后一次证明忠诚的机会。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"你不杀我？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"堇","content":"我会去找业师，请求她撤销对您的刺杀……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"堇","content":"我不会让您死的。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"你这样回去，业师会放过你？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"content":"堇又一次笑了，如同过去一样，温柔、和煦，只是眼中含着泪。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"堇","content":"我一生中最幸运的事情，就是遇见了您。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"堇","content":"我从来都配不上堇这朵花的名字。我只是一只躲在黑暗的角落里、伤人的毒虫。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"堇","content":"可您却闯进了黑暗，为我带来了一束……光。现在，该为了这束光，重回黑暗了。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"content":"堇转过身。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"堇","content":"再会了。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"options":["拦住她"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302112,"trial_step":112,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"拦住她","goto":113}]},{"step":113,"content":"你费尽全身力气，踉跄着站起身，试图发动枷锁的力量，阻止她离开。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"可随之而来的剧烈头痛使你失去重心，重重摔倒在地上。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"堇原本已经走到门口，听到声音回头看向了你。她在黑暗里，你看不清她的表情，只看到她的肩膀在微微颤抖。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"终于，堇还是转过头，消失于黑暗之中。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"content":"不知过了多久，你再次醒来，周围的一切，逐渐清晰起来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"房间里有明显的打斗痕迹——打坏的书柜、一个空针筒，以及一个小小的金属罐。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"你艰难起身，打开了办公室里的监控录像。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"女人的声音","content":"你真的要背叛业师吗，堇？","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"堇","content":"……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"女人的声音","content":"就为了这个男人？！","female_content":"就为了这个女人？！","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"堇","content":"嗯。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"speaker":"女人的声音","content":"他不能活。","female_content":"她不能活。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"content":"女人举起了刀刃横在眼前。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"speaker":"堇","content":"……我要救他。","female_content":"……我要救她。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"电光火石之间，堇侧身躲过致命的突刺。而她手中的刀刃，穿过一绺鬓发，在对方的右眼处绽开一朵血色的花。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"content":"一声闷哼后，袭击者捂着眼睛跪坐在地上。堇缓缓上前，拿走了袭击者随身携带的小包。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"speaker":"堇","content":"解毒剂……事情果然还有转圜的余地。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"speaker":"堇","content":"你走吧。告诉业师，我会回去见她的。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"content":"堇目送女人离开后，才转身走向你，将解毒的针剂扎在你手上。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"content":"紧接着，镜头中的你醒了过来。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"content":"你抬起手，发现手背上并没有什么紫花，只有一个小小的针孔。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"堇从未想过杀你，你错怪了她。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"options":["追回堇"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302135,"trial_step":135,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"追回堇","goto":136}]},{"step":136,"content":"你沿着堇的踪迹，蹒跚地沿着走廊一路走出管理局。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"你的能力还在，可以依靠与禁闭者之间的联系大致感应到她的方向。即便头还在痛，却已经几乎不会影响你的行动了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"content":"绝不能容许她就这么一走了之。你必须找到她。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":230302138,"trial_step":138}]}